---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout title="Contact | Nipponexus" description="How to contact Nipponexus, including reporting errors in articles, and operator information." locale="en" altLang="https://nipponexus.com/contact/">
  <section class="index-hero"><div class="hero-content"><h1 class="hero-title">Contact</h1></div></section>
  <article class="container-narrow article-body">
    <p>You can contact us in the following ways. All correspondence is handled in writing.</p>
    <h2>Reporting errors in articles</h2>
    <p>If you notice an error in dates, locations, cancellations or similar details, please use the "Report incorrect info" form at the bottom of the relevant article page. The page URL is submitted automatically, which allows us to respond most reliably and quickly.</p>
    <h2>Email</h2>
    <p>For enquiries about content, press matters or anything else, please write to info@nipponexus.com. Depending on the nature of the enquiry, a reply may take time or may not be possible.</p>
    <h2>Operator</h2>
    <p>Nexus Data Studio (sole proprietorship)<br />Address: Shinjuku Dai-7 Hayama Bldg. 3F, 1-36-2 Shinjuku, Shinjuku-ku, Tokyo 160-0022, Japan</p>
    <h2>Use of text and images</h2>
    <p>Articles are compiled from public sources including Wikidata and Wikipedia (CC BY-SA). Image licensing follows the terms of each provider. Please contact us in advance if you wish to reproduce material.</p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
